[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10810.23, "timestamp": "03:00:10", "text": "習俗，對吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10813.269, "timestamp": "03:00:13", "text": "？都是些普通的事，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10829.429, "timestamp": "03:00:29", "text": "這天，這裡就是一些普通的、隨意的慶祝活動，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10831.67, "timestamp": "03:00:31", "text": "在情人節。  嗯，它在哪裡？  是的。實例。我的天，那裡有九個人。謝謝。我們應該在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10844.67, "timestamp": "03:00:44", "text": "最後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10859.269, "timestamp": "03:00:59", "text": "加入吧？等等，"}]